DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42630::$$$message_0344_0000_0000$$$::".........(Heh.)"::
42631::$$$message_0344_0000_0001$$$::"......[wait canskip=0 time=300][se storage=se101.wav]......(grins)"::
42632::$$$message_0344_0000_0002$$$::"......[se storage=se044.wav]...(toothy smile)"[se storage=se038.wav]::
42633::$$$message_0344_0000_0003$$$::"...Whew. That's that."::
42634::$$$message_0344_0001_0000$$$::"It's tough being handsome.[lr]::
42635::$$$message_0344_0001_0001$$$::I gotta keep training even when no one's watching."::
42636::$$$message_0344_0001_0002$$$::"Impressive, Shinji.[lr]::
42637::$$$message_0344_0001_0003$$$::You're just like me when I was younger."::
42638::$$$message_0344_0001_0004$$$::"G-[hfchance layer=1]Grandfather!?[lr]::
42639::$$$message_0344_0001_0005$$$::A-aw, shucks. How long have you been watching?"::
42640::$$$message_0344_0001_0006$$$::"This entire time, ever since you started your image training.[lr]::
42641::$$$message_0344_0001_0007$$$::Haha. At first, I thought you'd lost your mind."::
42642::$$$message_0344_0001_0008$$$::"Hahaha. Man, you sure love to tease!"::
42643::$$$message_0344_0002_0000$$$::"I'm actually just getting warmed up. I can show you the full set if you want!"::
42644::$$$message_0344_0002_0001$$$::"The older sister is nice..."::
42645::$$$message_0344_0002_0002$$$::"Hm? Oh, Grandfather."::
42646::$$$message_0344_0003_0000$$$::"You must be here with some plan in mind. Can I help you with anything?"::
42647::$$$message_0344_0003_0001$$$::"Indeed.[lr]::
42648::$$$message_0344_0003_0002$$$::Shinji, have you heard of the Delusional Onsen lurking behind Ryudou Temple?"::
42649::$$$message_0344_0004_0000$$$::"Each year, it lets just one person in and grants their wish. Think of it as radiation leaking from the fusion reactor we call the Greater Grail."::
42650::$$$message_0344_0004_0001$$$::"No, I haven't. But...[hfsigh layer=1]I think I know what you're trying to say.[lr]::
42651::$$$message_0344_0004_0002$$$::You want me to visit the maid cafe in front of the train station."::
42652::$$$message_0344_0004_0003$$$::"Hahaha! Your ears are positively Avalon-grade!"::
42653::$$$message_0344_0004_0004$$$::"Aww, stop! Hahaha!"::
42654::$$$message_0344_0004_0005$$$::"To put it more simply, I want you to go to the onsen and have your wish granted."::
42655::$$$message_0344_0005_0000$$$::"What do you think? The maid cafe is but a fleeting dream. You can obtain a more lasting utopia, no?"::
42656::$$$message_0344_0006_0000$$$::"Imagine...once you're victorious, all of the girls you defeat on the way will become yours."::
42657::$$$message_0344_0006_0001$$$::"I-is that true, Grandfather!?"::
42658::$$$message_0344_0006_0002$$$::"It is. Now go."::
42659::$$$message_0344_0006_0003$$$::"...!"::
42660::$$$message_0344_0007_0000$$$::"...(sigh)[lr]::
42661::$$$message_0344_0007_0001$$$::Where did I go wrong, I wonder...":Òcè